  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The de Broglie wavelengths for an electron and a photon are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></math> respectively. For the same kinetic energy of electron and photon, which of the following presents the correct relation between the de Broglie wavelengths of two?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>De-Broglie wavelength for electron is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>For photon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></mfrac></math>. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><msqrt><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"
  }
}